    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/8a8a13d04b6f4bf27bbaa5300ab53061.poster.avif?t=1752840605\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/8a8a13d04b6f4bf27bbaa5300ab53061.webm?t=1752840605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/8a8a13d04b6f4bf27bbaa5300ab53061.mp4?t=1752840605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KUBEON - A NEON-FUELED RETRO ARCADE CHALLENGE !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the electrifying world of <strong>Kubeon</strong>, a fast-paced arcade game where every second matters! Control a simple cube and survive <strong>60 intense seconds</strong> of falling obstacles to reach the next level. Sounds easy? Think again\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/5609b35d900e0f74c5ff5d75e93896c7.poster.avif?t=1752840605\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/5609b35d900e0f74c5ff5d75e93896c7.webm?t=1752840605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/5609b35d900e0f74c5ff5d75e93896c7.mp4?t=1752840605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Short, intense, and merciless levels<br>\ud83d\udd37 Tight, responsive gameplay where precision is key<br>\ud83d\udd37 A hypnotic retro neon aesthetic<br>\ud83d\udd37 Multiples skins and stars to unlock<br>\ud83d\udd37 Brutal difficulty that will test your reflexes <br>\ud83d\udd37 Electro music done by talented artists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the fastest and most skilled will make it to the next level. <strong>Will you take up the challenge ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Add Kubeon to your wishlist and don\u2019t miss the release!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/8a8a13d04b6f4bf27bbaa5300ab53061.poster.avif?t=1752840605\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/8a8a13d04b6f4bf27bbaa5300ab53061.webm?t=1752840605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/8a8a13d04b6f4bf27bbaa5300ab53061.mp4?t=1752840605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KUBEON - A NEON-FUELED RETRO ARCADE CHALLENGE !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the electrifying world of <strong>Kubeon</strong>, a fast-paced arcade game where every second matters! Control a simple cube and survive <strong>60 intense seconds</strong> of falling obstacles to reach the next level. Sounds easy? Think again\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/5609b35d900e0f74c5ff5d75e93896c7.poster.avif?t=1752840605\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/5609b35d900e0f74c5ff5d75e93896c7.webm?t=1752840605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395740/extras/5609b35d900e0f74c5ff5d75e93896c7.mp4?t=1752840605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 Short, intense, and merciless levels<br>\ud83d\udd37 Tight, responsive gameplay where precision is key<br>\ud83d\udd37 A hypnotic retro neon aesthetic<br>\ud83d\udd37 Multiples skins and stars to unlock<br>\ud83d\udd37 Brutal difficulty that will test your reflexes <br>\ud83d\udd37 Electro music done by talented artists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the fastest and most skilled will make it to the next level. <strong>Will you take up the challenge ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Add Kubeon to your wishlist and don\u2019t miss the release!</strong></p>",
